  featureIntros:
  - id: BigCube
    title: Big Cube
    description: Hit multiple times to break big cube.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 89105df0ef35fea41b436e06195e6353, type: 3}
  - id: Qmark
    title: Qmark
    description: QMark stays hidden until the surrounding cubes are cleared.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9351af5faa78ca442b5cfda8e3d115af, type: 3}
  - id: Tunnel
    title: Tunnel
    description: Tunnel releases a new cube after the one in front is cleared. The
      number on it shows how many cubes are in line.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d8d5ae661249000409f2a1d52c5ec75b, type: 3}
  - id: Ice
    title: Ice
    description: To break the ice, you must send the three cubes next to it to the
      crusher.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: da4cd260a0139464bbbde01a29b180f1, type: 3}
  - id: Crate
    title: Crate
    description: Break the crate to reveal the hidden cubes inside.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 540fa9b18a7ba9a42bc2eb1bfc2c74f8, type: 3}
  - id: Cover
    title: Cover
    description: Each time a cube reaches the Crusher, the cover closes if it is
      open, or opens if it is closed.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8b0d05cfe6fa020428e601053918de92, type: 3}
  - id: Column
    title: Column
    description: "Smash the column to reach what\u2019s behind it."
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9801b77dc83c7db4f914e8014cc3cad3, type: 3}
